  "Question": "A tank has a capacity of 60 m³. A pump fills it at a rate of v m³/h, and the time needed to fill it is t h. If the tank must be filled within 4 hours (\\(t\\le4\\)), what is the minimum filling rate v in m³/h?",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "15",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\(vt=60\\), so \\(t=60/v\\). The condition \\(t\\le4\\) gives \\(60/v\\le4\\). Since \\(v>0\\), \\(v\\ge15\\), so the minimum rate is 15 m³/h.",
